  "releaseNotes": "Made sure peSHIr.Text.FormatAndParseHelper does not lead to ambiguity in code base that this code is moved out of. This is a breaking change, but in alpha I should be the only user that can be bothered by this. Also added peSHIr.Calculation.WeightedAverage (+some tests). Still not everything is all documented and unit tested properly; this is still a work in progress, mostly for internal reuse for now. (The matrix code from https://www.microsoft.com/en-us/research/people/jammc with some extra usability wrappers still has not made the cut just yet.)",
